/**
\fn pdg::Sprite::transitionToAnimation(string clip, number timeSeconds, number durationSeconds)
\brief Blend the current pose into a selected clip.

Starts the destination clip at the requested time while blending from the current base pose. Interrupting a transition captures its current blended pose. A zero duration switches immediately. Completion sends action_AnimationBlendComplete when the Sprite belongs to a layer.

\param clip Name of a compatible clip in the current Spriter entity.
\param timeSeconds Finite sample time in seconds. Looping clips wrap, including negative times; nonlooping clips clamp to their endpoints.
\param durationSeconds Finite nonnegative blend duration in seconds; zero switches immediately.

\return No value.

\note Call enableAnimationPose() successfully before using this method. Call outside animation callbacks.

\par Example
\code{.js}
sprite.transitionToAnimation('reference', 0, 0.3);
\endcode

\see seekAnimation(), isAnimationTransitioning(), getAnimationTransitionProgress()
*/
